            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Verdant Burst"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(healing)\n\nWhen a leshy dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from its body, restoring 2d8 Hit Points to each plant creature in a 30-foot emanation. This area is filled with plants of the same type as the leshy, becoming difficult terrain. If the terrain isn't a viable environment for these plants, they wither after 24 hours."
